  m_text: "Your \"mysteries\" have been FAR too easy so far. It's time to make it
    more complicated. WAY more complicated. In fact, this is the ULTIMATUM. You're
    going to have to solve a murder and eventually trace it back to the Napoleon
    of Crime, Professor Moriarty. That's only Step 1! Then, you have to blast him
    off the face of the planet and live to tell the tale. Brace yourself, for this
    is it - \nthe hardest challenge yet.\n"
