  m_text: 'A person at the penultimate stop, Moscow, tells you that Moriarty has
    fled to "The Land of the Folds". But before you can board a ship, your horse
    carriage breaks down among piles of street vendors and the old television jabbering
    about new lock-breaking technology. You have some money, grease (for no reason
    whatsoever), measuring tape, a random cushion of sorts, a magnifying glass, and
    an envelope. What combination of implements must you use to utilize the least
    number of tools AND come out unscathed?                                                                                                                                                   '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
